WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:06.992
The arrow was floating near the boulder.

2
00:00:06.993 --> 00:00:11.192
"Arrow, let's go!" Cora said.

3
00:00:11.193 --> 00:00:18.136
Cora swam after the arrow.

4
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:21.811
It led right to Stan.

5
00:00:21.812 --> 00:00:25.463
"The sharks are heading this way," Cora said.

6
00:00:25.464 --> 00:00:28.449
"Oh no!" Mo cried.

7
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.477
"Stan, I need your help," Cora said.

8
00:00:32.478 --> 00:00:38.997
Stan did a flip. "I have an idea."

9
00:00:38.998 --> 00:00:46.345
Stan whispered his plan to Cora.

10
00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:50.746
Soon the sharks came to the reef.

11
00:00:50.747 --> 00:00:53.967
Cora and Stan were ready.

12
00:00:53.968 --> 00:00:59.376
"Hey, sharks, over here!" Cora said.

13
00:00:59.377 --> 00:01:03.156
The sharks zoomed toward her.

14
00:01:03.157 --> 00:01:08.672
She changed to look like yellow coral.

15
00:01:08.673 --> 00:01:14.080
They couldn't see her!

16
00:01:14.081 --> 00:01:19.480
"No! Over here!" Stan called.

17
00:01:19.481 --> 00:01:23.941
The sharks zoomed his way.

18
00:01:23.942 --> 00:01:29.196
He changed to look like a rock!

19
00:01:29.197 --> 00:01:32.668
"Over here!" Cora called.

20
00:01:32.669 --> 00:01:36.389
The sharks zoomed back and forth.

21
00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:45.324
She changed to look like seaweed.

22
00:01:45.325 --> 00:01:51.199
Stan changed to look like sand.

23
00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:54.020
The sharks looked confused.

24
00:01:54.021 --> 00:01:57.621
"This reef is weird," one said.

25
00:01:57.622 --> 00:02:03.042
"Yeah, this place is spooky," said the other.

26
00:02:03.043 --> 00:02:08.319
The sharks swam away.

27
00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:14.886
Rita appeared. "You two are a good team!"

28
00:02:14.887 --> 00:02:18.487
"Thanks!" Cora and Stan said.

29
00:02:18.488 --> 00:02:28.883
Mo grinned. "You both win the hiding contest!"

